1
00:00:00,428 --> 00:00:04,138
[AS JAR JAR BINKS]
Oh, meesa think yousa looking so, so sad.

2
00:00:06,101 --> 00:00:07,231
(Leonard:)Rather than mock me...

3
00:00:07,394 --> 00:00:11,024
...my friends might realize this is difficult
and try to help me through it.

4
00:00:11,731 --> 00:00:13,521
(Raj:)Nope, I think mocking you is more fun.

5
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:19,610
(Howard:)Next time, don't yousa bring mama to work.
Okee-day?

6
00:00:21,074 --> 00:00:22,114
(Leonard:)That was fast.

7
00:00:22,284 --> 00:00:25,284
(Beverley:)Oh, the middle stall was occupied.
I'll have to try again later.

8
00:00:26,162 --> 00:00:29,542
(Sheldon:)It's totally understandable.
In bladder voiding, as in real estate...

9
00:00:29,708 --> 00:00:32,498
(Sheldon:)...it's location, location, location.

10
00:00:33,837 --> 00:00:34,877
(Beverley:)So where were we?

11
00:00:35,046 --> 00:00:39,676
(Leonard:)Howard lives with his mother and Raj can't
speak to women unless he's drunk. Go.

12
00:00:41,428 --> 00:00:45,138
Oh, that's fascinating.
Selective mutism is quite rare.

13
00:00:45,557 --> 00:00:49,187
(Beverley:)On the other hand, an adult Jewish male
living with his mother is so common...

14
00:00:49,352 --> 00:00:52,192
...it borders on sociological cliché.

15
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:56,030
(Howard:)It's just temporary. I pay rent.

